; region_key_dead_relation_1 -- the R3a no-crash/no-reject POSITIVE witness
; (4-mode golden, no .drflags; the correctness-lifecycle-2 amendment's
; directed case): a WELL-FORMED bracket on a #local whose flows are dead
; (defined, never consumed -- dead-flow-eliminated under df opt, unused-view
; collected otherwise) parses, resolves, and then constrains NOTHING: no
; demand ever reaches `dead`, Step-2b never runs, and no belt crashes over
; the eliminated views. The program compiles and answers in all 4 modes.
#message edge_2(u64 From, u64 To).
#local live(u64 From, u64 To).
live(F, T) : edge_2(F, T).
#local dead[X](u64 X, u64 Y).
dead(X, Y) : edge_2(X, Y).
#query q_all(free u64 From, free u64 To) : live(From, To).
